    {
      "id": "proof",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 850,
      "y": 435,
      "width": 338.9458312988281,
      "height": 55,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aX",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 40,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 304479695,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795091834929,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "|r − r₀| ≤ |r − p| + |p − r₀|\n        ≤ τ + τ = 2τ = 6 bpm",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "|r − r₀| ≤ |r − p| + |p − r₀|\n        ≤ τ + τ = 2τ = 6 bpm",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "proof-2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 850,
      "y": 515,
      "width": 409.7596740722656,
      "height": 71.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 41,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 161270433,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795091834929,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So if r and r₀ are both marked stable and\n|r − r₀| > 2τ, at least one broke the promise.\nThat is a real miss, not a judgment call.",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So if r and r₀ are both marked stable and\n|r − r₀| > 2τ, at least one broke the promise.\nThat is a real miss, not a judgment call.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "proof-3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 850,
      "y": 623,
      "width": 405.1211242675781,
      "height": 23.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 42,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 56847343,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795091834929,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "played k× faster:  |r − k·r₀| ≤ τ(1 + k)",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "played k× faster:  |r − k·r₀| ≤ τ(1 + k)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
