      "text": "no readings               →  No reading\n≥ 3 s off and > 20% of\n  stable readings         →  Confident but off\n≥ 50% of readings stable  →  Held\notherwise                 →  Flagged",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "no readings               →  No reading\n≥ 3 s off and > 20% of\n  stable readings         →  Confident but off\n≥ 50% of readings stable  →  Held\notherwise                 →  Flagged",
      "autoResize": true,
